sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant N as Network (VM)
    participant C as Collector
    participant DB as InfluxDB
    participant L as Control loop
    participant T as Twin
    participant X as Executor
    participant A as AP agent

    loop every 1 s
        C->>N: GET stats
        C->>DB: write records
    end
    L->>X: check()
    X->>DB: KPIs since change
    X-->>A: revert if worse
    L->>DB: last 10 s
    L->>T: build TwinState
    L->>L: heuristics propose
    L->>T: verify(actions)
    T-->>L: Verdict
    L->>X: record(actions, verdicts)
    alt accepted, no approval needed
        L->>X: apply(action)
        X->>A: POST change
        X->>X: watch 30 s
    else needs approval
        X-->>L: wait for operator
    end
